# The M1 xylophone: 72, 74, 76 on a PCA9685, polyphony 2, 30 ms at velocity 127 down to
# 12 ms at velocity 1, 60 ms between repeats, 30% duty of 1000 ms.
body ../../bodies/m1-xylophone.hex
0 on 72 127 struck 30
0 is-on 72 yes
# still striking
10 on 72 127 busy
29 is-on 72 yes
30 is-on 72 no
# struck 40 ms ago, under its 60 ms interval
40 on 72 127 interval
60 on 72 127 struck 30
# velocity scales the pulse: 12 + 18 * (velocity - 1) / 126, rounded down
200 on 74 1 struck 12
300 on 74 64 struck 21
400 on 74 100 struck 26
400 on 74 127 busy
# not one of its notes
500 on 60 127 notmine
# polyphony 2
600 on 72 127 struck 30
600 on 74 127 struck 30
600 on 76 127 polyphony
629 on 76 127 polyphony
630 on 76 127 struck 30
# panic ends a strike now, but its interval still counts
700 on 72 127 struck 30
705 panic
705 is-on 72 no
710 on 72 127 interval
760 on 72 127 struck 30
# a Note On at velocity 0 is a Note Off: nothing happens
900 on 76 0 none
900 is-on 76 no
